        "content": "## \ud83d\udc26 Bird Home \u2014 Prediction Lab\n**One-hour-ahead bird activity forecasting** \u00b7 live forward validation  \nRandom Forest and XGBoost issue independent forecasts for the same future hour and are scored against observed BirdNET activity."
